span><br><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">붙임 공고문 등 1부.&nbsp; 끝. </span></span></font></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
